{"seq":4,"slug":"ml-pipeline","title":"ML Pipeline 与部署","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/python-advanced/engineering/ml-pipeline","wordCount":902,"readingTime":4,"html":"<h1 id=\"ml-pipeline-与部署\">ML Pipeline 与部署</h1><h2 id=\"概述\">概述</h2><p>从 Jupyter Notebook 中的实验代码到可复现、可部署的机器学习系统，需要将数据处理和模型训练组织为标准化的 Pipeline。本文介绍 scikit-learn Pipeline、MLflow 实验追踪，以及模型服务化部署的最佳实践。</p>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>ML 工程化的难点不在建模，而在于把&quot;实验&quot;变成&quot;系统&quot;。围绕这条主线，三个组件各司其职：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>组件</th>\n<th>解决的问题</th>\n<th>关键机制</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>sklearn Pipeline</td>\n<td>流程封装与防泄漏</td>\n<td><code>fit</code> 仅在训练集上进行，整条链可序列化</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>MLflow</td>\n<td>实验可追溯</td>\n<td>记录参数、指标、产物，支持模型注册与版本</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>FastAPI + Pydantic</td>\n<td>模型服务化与校验</td>\n<td>声明式请求/响应模型，自动生成接口文档</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>其中最容易被忽视的是<strong>数据泄漏</strong>：如果标准化器或编码器在划分训练集之前就对全量数据 <code>fit</code>，测试集的信息会渗入训练过程，导致线上表现远低于离线评估。Pipeline 强制把预处理与模型绑定为同一个对象，并保证交叉验证时每一步的 <code>fit</code> 都只在当折的训练子集上进行——这正是它不可替代的价值。</p>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"scikit-learn-pipeline\">scikit-learn Pipeline</h2><h3 id=\"基本管道\">基本管道</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"from sklearn.pipeline import Pipeline&#10;from sklearn.preprocessing import StandardScaler&#10;from sklearn.ensemble import RandomForestClassifier&#10;&#10;pipe = Pipeline([&#10;    (&quot;scaler&quot;, StandardScaler()),&#10;    (&quot;clf&quot;, RandomForestClassifier(n_estimators=100)),&#10;])&#10;&#10;pipe.fit(X_train, y_train)&#10;score = pipe.score(X_test, y_test)&#10;predictions = pipe.predict(X_new)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> sklearn.pipeline </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> Pipeline</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> sklearn.preprocessing </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> StandardScaler</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> sklearn.ensemble </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> RandomForestClassifier</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">pipe </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> Pipeline([</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    (</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"scaler\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, StandardScaler()),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    (</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"clf\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, RandomForestClassifier(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">n_estimators</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">100</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">])</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">pipe.fit(X_train, y_train)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">score </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> pipe.score(X_test, y_test)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">predictions </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> pipe.predict(X_new)</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"列变换器\">列变换器</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"from sklearn.compose import ColumnTransformer&#10;from sklearn.preprocessing import OneHotEncoder, StandardScaler&#10;&#10;preprocessor = ColumnTransformer([&#10;    (&quot;num&quot;, StandardScaler(), [&quot;age&quot;, &quot;income&quot;]),&#10;    (&quot;cat&quot;, OneHotEncoder(handle_unknown=&quot;ignore&quot;), [&quot;gender&quot;, &quot;city&quot;]),&#10;])&#10;&#10;full_pipe = Pipeline([&#10;    (&quot;preprocess&quot;, preprocessor),&#10;    (&quot;clf&quot;, RandomForestClassifier()),&#10;])\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> sklearn.compose </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ColumnTransformer</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> sklearn.preprocessing </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> OneHotEncoder, StandardScaler</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">preprocessor </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ColumnTransformer([</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    (</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"num\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, StandardScaler(), [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"age\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"income\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    (</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"cat\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, OneHotEncoder(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">handle_unknown</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"ignore\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">), [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"gender\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"city\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">])</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">full_pipe </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> Pipeline([</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    (</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"preprocess\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, preprocessor),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    (</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"clf\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, RandomForestClassifier()),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">])</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"自定义-transformer\">自定义 Transformer</h3><p>当内置的预处理步骤无法满足需求时，可以通过继承 <code>BaseEstimator</code> 和 <code>TransformerMixin</code> 创建自定义 Transformer，使其无缝嵌入 Pipeline：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"from sklearn.base import BaseEstimator, TransformerMixin&#10;import numpy as np&#10;&#10;class LogTransformer(BaseEstimator, TransformerMixin):&#10;    def __init__(self, offset=1.0):&#10;        self.offset = offset&#10;&#10;    def fit(self, X, y=None):&#10;        return self&#10;&#10;    def transform(self, X):&#10;        return np.log(X + self.offset)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> sklearn.base </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> BaseEstimator, TransformerMixin</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> numpy </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">as</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> np</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">class</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> LogTransformer</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">BaseEstimator</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">TransformerMixin</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    def</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> __init__</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(self, offset</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1.0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.offset </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> offset</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> fit</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(self, X, y</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">None</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        return</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> self</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> transform</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(self, X):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> np.log(X </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.offset)</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"pipeline-优势\">Pipeline 优势</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>优势</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>防止数据泄漏</td>\n<td>fit 仅在训练集上进行</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>可复现</td>\n<td>完整流程封装为一个对象</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>可序列化</td>\n<td><code>joblib.dump(pipe, &quot;model.pkl&quot;)</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>超参搜索</td>\n<td>与 GridSearchCV 无缝集成</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"超参数调优\">超参数调优</h2><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"from sklearn.model_selection import GridSearchCV&#10;&#10;param_grid = {&#10;    &quot;clf__n_estimators&quot;: [50, 100, 200],&#10;    &quot;clf__max_depth&quot;: [5, 10, None],&#10;}&#10;&#10;search = GridSearchCV(full_pipe, param_grid, cv=5, scoring=&quot;accuracy&quot;, n_jobs=-1)&#10;search.fit(X_train, y_train)&#10;print(search.best_params_)&#10;print(search.best_score_)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> sklearn.model_selection </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> GridSearchCV</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">param_grid </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    \"clf__n_estimators\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">50</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">100</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">200</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    \"clf__max_depth\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">5</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">10</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">None</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">search </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> GridSearchCV(full_pipe, param_grid, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">cv</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">5</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">scoring</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"accuracy\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">n_jobs</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=-</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">search.fit(X_train, y_train)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">print</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(search.best_params_)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">print</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(search.best_score_)</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>方法</th>\n<th>搜索策略</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>GridSearchCV</td>\n<td>网格搜索</td>\n<td>参数空间小</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>RandomizedSearchCV</td>\n<td>随机搜索</td>\n<td>参数空间大</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Optuna</td>\n<td>贝叶斯优化</td>\n<td>复杂模型调优</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"mlflow-实验追踪\">MLflow 实验追踪</h2><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"import mlflow&#10;&#10;mlflow.set_experiment(&quot;classification-v1&quot;)&#10;&#10;with mlflow.start_run():&#10;    mlflow.log_param(&quot;n_estimators&quot;, 100)&#10;    mlflow.log_param(&quot;max_depth&quot;, 10)&#10;&#10;    pipe.fit(X_train, y_train)&#10;    accuracy = pipe.score(X_test, y_test)&#10;&#10;    mlflow.log_metric(&quot;accuracy&quot;, accuracy)&#10;    mlflow.sklearn.log_model(pipe, &quot;model&quot;)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> mlflow</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">mlflow.set_experiment(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"classification-v1\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">with</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> mlflow.start_run():</span></span>\n<