ss=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    prob </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> model.predict_proba(df)[</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">].max()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> PredictResponse(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">prediction</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">int</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(pred), </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">probability</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">float</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(prob))</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"docker-容器化\">Docker 容器化</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"dockerfile\" data-code=\"FROM python:3.12-slim&#10;WORKDIR /app&#10;COPY requirements.txt .&#10;RUN pip install --no-cache-dir -r requirements.txt&#10;COPY . .&#10;CMD [&quot;uvicorn&quot;, &quot;main:app&quot;, &quot;--host&quot;, &quot;0.0.0.0&quot;, &quot;--port&quot;, &quot;8000&quot;]\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>FROM python:3.12-slim</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>WORKDIR /app</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>COPY requirements.txt .</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>RUN pip install --no-cache-dir -r requirements.txt</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>COPY . .</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>CMD [\"uvicorn\", \"main:app\", \"--host\", \"0.0.0.0\", \"--port\", \"8000\"]</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"健康检查与版本管理\">健康检查与版本管理</h3><p>生产环境中模型服务需要包含健康检查端点和模型版本信息，以便于运维监控和灰度发布：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"@app.get(&quot;/health&quot;)&#10;def health():&#10;    return {&quot;status&quot;: &quot;ok&quot;, &quot;model_version&quot;: &quot;v1.2.0&quot;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">@app.get</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"/health\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> health</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">():</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"status\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"ok\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"model_version\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"v1.2.0\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"完整-ml-工程流程\">完整 ML 工程流程</h2><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;  A[数据采集] --&gt; B[特征工程 Pipeline]&#10;  B --&gt; C[模型训练]&#10;  C --&gt; D[MLflow 记录]&#10;  D --&gt; E[模型注册]&#10;  E --&gt; F[FastAPI 服务化]&#10;  F --&gt; G[Docker 部署]&#10;  G --&gt; H[监控与重训练]\">graph LR\n  A[数据采集] --&gt; B[特征工程 Pipeline]\n  B --&gt; C[模型训练]\n  C --&gt; D[MLflow 记录]\n  D --&gt; E[模型注册]\n  E --&gt; F[FastAPI 服务化]\n  F --&gt; G[Docker 部署]\n  G --&gt; H[监控与重训练]</pre><hr>\n<h2 id=\"最佳实践\">最佳实践</h2><ul>\n<li>使用 sklearn Pipeline 封装完整的预处理 + 模型流程</li>\n<li>每次实验用 MLflow 记录参数和指标，确保可追溯</li>\n<li>模型部署使用 FastAPI + Pydantic 做输入校验</li>\n<li>Docker 镜像使用 slim 基础镜像减小体积</li>\n<li>设置模型监控（数据漂移检测），触发自动重训练</li>\n<li>在 Pipeline 中加入特征选择步骤（如 <code>SelectKBest</code>），减少过拟合风险</li>\n<li>使用 <code>Pipeline.get_params()</code> 导出完整的超参配置，便于实验复现</li>\n</ul>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>ML 工程化的核心是把实验变成可复现系统，由 Pipeline、实验追踪、服务化三部分支撑。</li>\n<li>sklearn Pipeline 封装预处理与模型，防止数据泄漏，可序列化并接入超参搜索。</li>\n<li><code>ColumnTransformer</code> 处理异构列，自定义 Transformer 需继承 <code>BaseEstimator</code> 与 <code>TransformerMixin</code>。</li>\n<li>超参搜索按参数空间选型：网格、随机、贝叶斯（Optuna）。</li>\n<li>MLflow 记录参数、指标与产物，Model Registry 管理模型版本与阶段。</li>\n<li>服务化用 FastAPI + Pydantic 做输入校验，Docker 容器化并加入健康检查与版本管理。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"ML Pipeline 与部署","id":"ml-pipeline-与部署"},{"level":2,"text":"概述","id":"概述"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"scikit-learn Pipeline","id":"scikit-learn-pipeline"},{"level":3,"text":"基本管道","id":"基本管道"},{"level":3,"text":"列变换器","id":"列变换器"},{"level":3,"text":"自定义 Transformer","id":"自定义-transformer"},{"level":3,"text":"Pipeline 优势","id":"pipeline-优势"},{"level":2,"text":"超参数调优","id":"超参数调优"},{"level":2,"text":"MLflow 实验追踪","id":"mlflow-实验追踪"},{"level":3,"text":"MLflow 核心概念","id":"mlflow-核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"模型序列化","id":"模型序列化"},{"level":2,"text":"模型服务化","id":"模型服务化"},{"level":3,"text":"FastAPI 部署","id":"fastapi-部署"},{"level":3,"text":"Docker 容器化","id":"docker-容器化"},{"level":3,"text":"健康检查与版本管理","id":"健康检查与版本管理"},{"level":2,"text":"完整 ML 工程流程","id":"完整-ml-工程流程"},{"level":2,"text":"最佳实践","id":"最佳实践"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"性能分析与优化","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/python-advanced/engineering/profiling"},"next":null}